{"id": "102", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to sync audiobooks from iPhone to iTunes:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. Click on the \"Audiobooks\" tab on the left side of the iTunes window.\n4. Check the boxes next to the audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them to your iPhone.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to finish the syncing process.\n\nAlternatively, you can use Syncios Audiobook Transfer to transfer audiobooks from your computer to your iOS device. To do this, follow these steps:\n\n1. Launch Syncios Audiobook Transfer on your computer.\n2. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n3. Click on the \"Books\" tab on the top menu bar.\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from your computer to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Import\" button to transfer the selected audiobooks to your iPhone.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, first launch iTunes on your computer and connect your iPhone using a USB cable. Once connected, click on the name of your iPhone under Devices in the left column of iTunes. Then, choose the \"Books\" section above the main iTunes window. Select the audiobooks you want to sync from your iPhone to iTunes. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the specific audiobooks you wish to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to sync all of them. Finally, click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, first launch iTunes on your computer and connect your iPhone using a USB cable. Once connected, click on the name of your iPhone under Devices in the left column of iTunes. Then, choose the \"Books\" section above the main iTunes window. Select the audiobooks you want to sync from your iPhone to iTunes. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the specific audiobooks you wish to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to sync all of them. Finally, click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "time_sec": 23.337, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1156, 7050, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 323, 4564, 697, 12167, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 13, 9646, 8433, 11, 4205, 389, 279, 829, 315, 697, 12167, 1212, 40377, 304, 279, 2115, 3250, 315, 13025, 13, 5005, 11, 5157, 279, 330, 24341, 1, 3772, 3403, 279, 1887, 13025, 3241, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 504, 697, 12167, 311, 13025, 13, 9189, 279, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 3137, 323, 5157, 279, 3151, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 6426, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 12811, 678, 315, 1105, 13, 17375, 11, 4205, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0065, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0002, -1.133, -0.0026, -0.635, -0.0068, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.1411, -0.0015, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0344, -0.7843, -0.2439, -0.0001, -0.0022, -0.0437, -0.0, -0.0179, -0.0182, -0.0789, -0.0346, -0.3712, -0.0621, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0036, -1.1074, -0.0432, -0.0113, -0.2266, -0.2847, -0.0549, -0.7106, -0.0, -0.0022, -0.0627, -0.6009, -0.4826, -0.0149, -0.0019, -0.0026, -0.0245, -0.6792, -0.0701, -0.0118, -0.4896, -0.5362, -0.8972, -0.6281, -0.7956, -0.0056, -0.0, -0.5728, -0.5485, -0.0001, -0.0013, -0.0436, -0.0008, -0.0953, -0.8065, -0.005, -0.0147, -0.0163, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.5256, -0.0009