{"id": "261", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals, and enabling the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10 which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective. Additionally, MSM powder helps relieve muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation caused by injury or diseases like arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals, and enabling the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10 which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective. Additionally, MSM powder helps relieve muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation caused by injury or diseases like arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "time_sec": 18.549, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 11, 7703, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 85287, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 36393, 1741, 438, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 323, 27362,