{"id": "414", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to first obtain a Shugabush monster from the Shugabush Island. Then, hatch the eggs obtained and purchase the breeding structure. Finally, use a Shugabush and a Furcorn in the breeding structure to create a Shugabeats monster.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Once obtained, the Shugabush will turn into an egg which you need to hatch. After hatching, you must buy the breeding structure on the Shugabush Island. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn together in the breeding structure to successfully breed the Shugabeats. The order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Once obtained, the Shugabush will turn into an egg which you need to hatch. After hatching, you must buy the breeding structure on the Shugabush Island. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn together in the breeding structure to successfully breed the Shugabeats. The order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.", "time_sec": 19.745, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1969, 1156, 6851, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 13, 9646, 12180, 11, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 686, 2484, 1119, 458, 18636, 892, 498, 1184, 311, 43255, 13, 4636, 305, 31924, 11, 498, 1969, 3695, 279, 39208, 5944, 389, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 13, 5005, 11, 990, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 3786, 304, 279, 39208, 5944, 311, 7790, 277