{"id": "504", "question": "what are the characteristics of tropical rainforest floor", "gt": "The floor of a tropical rainforest biome is characterized by a fast rate of decay due to the heat and moisture. This decay provides rich nutrients for other plants to grow. Various types of fruits, nuts, herbs, and mushrooms grow on the rainforest floor. Additionally, vines and ferns grow all over the rainforest, including the floor, helping to connect the various layers of the biome.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the tropical rainforest floor has herbs and mushrooms growing on it. It also receives a large amount of rainfall, with some areas getting up to 400 inches annually, and the climate is very humid due to the constant warmth and moisture. The heat and moisture cause dead plants and animals to rot quickly, which releases rich nutrients into the soil, supporting the growth of other plants.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the tropical rainforest floor has herbs and mushrooms growing on it. It also receives a large amount of rainfall, with some areas getting up to 400 inches annually, and the climate is very humid due to the constant warmth and moisture. The heat and moisture cause dead plants and animals to rot quickly, which releases rich nutrients into the soil, supporting the growth of other plants.", "time_sec": 15.537, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 34048, 11174, 50655, 6422, 702, 41293, 323, 47151, 7826, 389, 432, 13, 1084, 1083, 21189, 264, 3460, 3311, 315, 52858, 11, 448, 1045, 5671, 3709, 705, 311, 220, 19, 15, 15, 14924, 29071, 11, 323, 279, 9977, 374, 1602, 65938, 4152, 311, 279, 6783, 40363, 323, 31157, 13, 576, 8628, 323, 31157, 5240, 5593, 10779, 323, 9898, 311, 5749, 6157, 11, 892, 19232, 9080, 36393, 1119, 279, 17171, 11, 12613, 279, 6513, 315, 1008, 10779, 13, 151645], "logp_