{"id": "533", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an injured arm, securing a bandana over a bleeding wound, and helping to keep a severe wound closed. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used to immobilize an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling. They can be used to secure a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg. They can even be used to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "time_sec": 17.295, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 7149, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 311, 76341, 551, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 13, 2379, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 9767, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 13, 2379, 646, 1496, 387, 1483, 311, 1492, 2506, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 13, 22406, 11, 7149, 26944, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 4057, 12503, 49940, 304, 279, 48262, 13, 151645], "logp_list": 