{"id": "546", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some traits associated with people born in October:\n\n* Interest in form and structure (Passage 1)\n* Success-oriented and charming (Passage 2)\n* Personal power and impatience (Passage 2)\n* Crave stability and security (Passage 3)\n\nHowever, it's important to note that these are generalizations based on astrological signs and not all individuals will exhibit these traits. Additionally, there is no information about specific personality traits or characteristics of people born in October. Therefore, I cannot provide a more detailed answer based solely on the given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific date. For example, those born on October 1 are described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, preferring to be in control or work independently, though they possess good people skills despite occasional impatience. Individuals born on October 5 are characterized as restless at heart but craving stability and security, which drives them to work hard. Additionally, people born on October 14 are noted to have a strong interest in form and structure, making them well-suited for careers in architecture, interior design, or other fields combining art and structure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific date. For example, those born on October 1 are described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, preferring to be in control or work independently, though they possess good people skills despite occasional impatience. Individuals born on October 5 are characterized as restless at heart but craving stability and security, which drives them to work hard. Additionally, people born on October 14 are noted to have a strong interest in form and structure, making them well-suited for careers in architecture, interior design, or other fields combining art and structure.", "time_sec": 22.831, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1251, 9223, 304, 6527, 614, 5257, 24055, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 2400, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 1846, 9223, 389, 6527, 220, 16, 525, 7481, 438, 2393, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 11, 97617, 311, 387, 304, 2524, 476, 975, 28135, 11, 3498, 807, 15218, 1661, 1251, 7361, 8818, 27861, 3163, 266, 1835, 13, 61425, 9223, 389, 6527, 220, 20, 525, 31871, 438, 88258, 518, 4746, 714, 63704, 19753, 323, 4763, 11, 892, 20118, 1105, 311, 975, 2588, 13, 22406, 11, 1251, 9223, 389, 6527, 220, 16, 19, 525, 10342, 311, 614, 264, 3746, 2734, 304, 1352, 323, 5944, 11, 3259, 1105, 1632, 86129, 1608, 369, 30033, 304, 17646, 11, 14791, 2884, 11, 476, 1008, 5043, 34171, 1947, 323, 5944, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.1399, -0.0001, -0.2078, -0.0001, -0.6593, -0.8951, -0.0062, -0.2032, -0.0, -0.4767, -0.0759, -0.074, -0.0134, -0.7258, -0.2992, -0.0003, -0.1603, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0041, -0.078, -0.1618, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.1833, -0.0117, -0.0, -0.5426, -0.2771, -0.0097, -0.0116, -0.0199, -0.0002, -0.3948, -0.4884, -0.0102, -0.6118, -0.3851, -0.0034, -1.1514, -0.1283, -0.2142, -0.0, -1.1055, -0.0038, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.6345, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0009, -0.0591, -0.8587, -0.1602, -0.025, -0.0385, -0.0, -0.3527, -1.1711, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.6569, -0.3919, -0.0236, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0422, -0.9192, -0.8585, 0.0, -0.7091, -0.0002, -0.0077, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.7707, -0.1081, -0.6933, -0.0011, -0.021, -0.5307, -0.0005, -0.0263, -0.3925, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0621, -0.1563, -0.001, -0.2414, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0164, -0.1329, -0.257, -0.0248, -0.0053, -0.4778, -0.6071, -