{"id": "574", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action as mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents by putting steel wool inside before sealing them, as steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the holes to re-enter. This adds an extra element of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Additionally, eliminate any sources of food or shelter, as rats and mice will consume discarded food and fit through tiny openings to access your home.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action as mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents by putting steel wool inside before sealing them, as steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the holes to re-enter. This adds an extra element of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Additionally, eliminate any sources of food or shelter, as rats and mice will consume discarded food and fit through tiny openings to access your home.", "time_sec": 19.851, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 438, 23627, 646, 1602, 6157, 1896, 705, 21682, 304, 697, 2114, 323, 1191, 667