{"id": "681", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit YouTube channels which provide tutorials on how to access these services, such as the video available at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. You could also use cloud VoIP services that require no equipment on your end. These services offer toll-free and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with SIP devices for outgoing calls. Additionally, companies offer DID or incoming numbers from around the world either for a flat yearly rate or a monthly fee.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can follow these steps: 1. Choose a VoIP service provider that offers free incoming numbers (DID) from around the world; 2. Visit a reputable company such as Google to get a free virtual phone number (VoIP); 3. Use the internet to place and receive calls with the VoIP number; 4. Ensure the service allows incoming calls from PSTN or mobile phones; 5. Some providers offer free numbers with a flat yearly or monthly fee for additional features.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can follow these steps: 1. Choose a VoIP service provider that offers free incoming numbers (DID) from around the world; 2. Visit a reputable company such as Google to get a free virtual phone number (VoIP); 3. Use the internet to place and receive calls with the VoIP number; 4. Ensure the service allows incoming calls from PSTN or mobile phones; 5. Some providers offer free numbers with a flat yearly or monthly fee for additional features.", "time_sec": 24.033, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 633, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 4540, 1372, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 25, 220,