{"id": "716", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, the following exercises are mentioned as toning the chest:\n\n* Modified tri-set for the chest (not specified)\n* Pushups\n* Dumbbell bench presses\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What exercises tone the chest?\" based on the given passages is:\n\nModified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. Additionally, the dumbbell fly exercise described—where you lie on your back with dumbbells in each hand, extend arms out to form a cross, slowly curl hands together until dumbbells meet above the chest center, then slowly return arms to sides—is also a chest-toning exercise.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. Additionally, the dumbbell fly exercise described—where you lie on your back with dumbbells in each hand, extend arms out to form a cross, slowly curl hands together until dumbbells meet above the chest center, then slowly return arms to sides—is also a chest-toning exercise.", "time_sec": 19.449, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 29255, 17250, 11466, 10158, 7481, 2293, 2870, 498, 10246, 389, 697, 1182, 448, 29255, 65, 6436, 304, 1817, 1424, 11, 13036, 11715, 700, 311, 1352, 264, 5312, 11, 13970, 13957, 6078, 3786, 3080, 29255, 65, 6436, 3367, 3403, 279, 15138, 4126, 11, 1221, 13970