{"id": "724", "question": "weather in wellesley", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley varies by day. On Tuesday, Aug 23, it is forecasted to be 82 degrees and sunny with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. Wednesday, Aug 24, will be 79 degrees and sunny with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. Thursday, Aug 18, is expected to be 83 degrees and sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. Friday, Aug 19, will also be 83 degrees and sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. Sunday, Aug 21, is forecasted to be 81 degrees and sunny with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. Monday, Aug 22, will be 77 degrees with moderate or heavy rain and thunder, a 52% chance of rain, and 8 mph winds from the South.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley varies by day. On Tuesday, Aug 23, it is forecasted to be 82 degrees and sunny with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. Wednesday, Aug 24, will be 79 degrees and sunny with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. Thursday, Aug 18, is expected to be 83 degrees and sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. Friday, Aug 19, will also be 83 degrees and sunny with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. Sunday, Aug 21, is forecasted to be 81 degrees and sunny with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. Monday, Aug 22, will be 77 degrees with moderate or heavy rain and thunder, a 52% chance of rain, and 8 mph winds from the South.", "time_sec": 48.415, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 9104, 304, 25006, 642, 3179, 34227, 553, 1899, 13, 1913, 7589, 