{"id": "264", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals, and enabling the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10 which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective. Additionally, MSM powder helps relieve muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation caused by injury or diseases like arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals, and enabling the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10 which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective. Additionally, MSM powder helps relieve muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation caused by injury or diseases like arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "time_sec": 18.106, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 10476, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852,