{"id": "299", "question": "how to make hot water heater circulate", "gt": "To make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump can be installed. This pump sends cool water from the pipes back to the water heater through a return line, while simultaneously pulling hot water from the heater to keep it hot. This continuous loop ensures that hot water is always available.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to make a hot water heater circulate, use a hot water circulation pump that sends cool water from the hot water lines back to the water heater through a return line. This pump continuously circulates water through the water heater to keep it hot. Alternatively, demand systems can be used, which circulate hot water when activated by a push of a button, a timer, or a motion sensor.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to make a hot water heater circulate, use a hot water circulation pump that sends cool water from the hot water lines back to the water heater through a return line. This pump continuously circulates water through the water heater to keep it hot. Alternatively, demand systems can be used, which circulate hot water when activated by a push of a button, a timer, or a motion sensor.", "time_sec": 15.244, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1281, 264, 4017, 3015, 42238, 4225, 6334, 11, 990, 264, 4017, 3015, 34755, 13834, 429, 21308, 7010, 3015, 504, 279, 4017, 3015, 5128, 1182, 311, 279, 3015, 42238, 1526, 264, 470, 1555, 13, 1096, 13834, 30878, 4225, 23156, 3015, 1526, 279, 3015, 42238, 311, 2506, 432, 4017, 13, 38478, 11, 7479, 5942, 646, 387, 1483, 11, 892, 4225, 6334, 4017, 3015, 979, 21985, 553, 264, 4484, 315, 264, 3137, 11, 264, 9021, 11, 476, 264, 11379, 12002, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0018, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0727, -0.0, -0.0372, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0