{"id": "415", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's what we know about breeding a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\n\n* We need to breed a Shugabush Monster with a Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get a Shugabeats.\n* The breeding combination for Shugabeats is Shugabush + Furcorn.\n* Breeding left or right does not matter.\n\nTherefore, to breed a Shugabeats, you need to have a Shugabush Monster and a Furcorn, and then breed them together in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\n\nAnswer: Breed a Shugabush Monster and a Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Once obtained, the Shugabush will turn into an egg which you need to hatch. After hatching, you must buy the breeding structure on the Shugabush Island. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn together in the breeding structure to successfully breed the Shugabeats. The order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Once obtained, the Shugabush will turn into an egg which you need to hatch. After hatching, you must buy the breeding structure on the Shugabush Island. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn together in the breeding structure to successfully breed the Shugabeats. The order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.", "time_sec": 19.187, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1969, 1156, 6851, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 13, 9646, 1