{"id": "427", "question": "what is a upc description", "gt": "Based on the given passages, I am unable to answer the question \"What is a UPC description?\" as none of the passages provide a clear definition or explanation of what a UPC description is.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, a UPC description is that the Universal Product Code (UPC) is a barcode symbology widely used in countries like the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand, and Europe to track trade items in stores. UPC-A consists of 12 numeric digits uniquely assigned to each trade item. It is primarily used for scanning trade items at the point of sale, along with the related EAN barcode, as per GS1 specifications.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, a UPC description is that the Universal Product Code (UPC) is a barcode symbology widely used in countries like the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Australia, New Zealand, and Europe to track trade items in stores. UPC-A consists of 12 numeric digits uniquely assigned to each trade item. It is primarily used for scanning trade items at the point of sale, along with the related EAN barcode, as per GS1 specifications.", "time_sec": 17.113, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 264, 95129, 4008, 374, 429, 279, 25500, 5643, 6119, 320, 3124, 34, 8, 374, 264, 49407, 66654, 2449, 13570, 1483, 304, 5837, 1075, 279, 3639, 4180, 11, 6864, 11, 279, 3639, 15072, 11, 8330, 11, 1532, 16911, 11, 323, 4505, 311, 3754, 6559, 3589, 304, 10533, 13, 95129, 6691, 17167, 315, 220, 16, 17, 24064, 18509, 41229, 12607, 311, 1817, 6559, 1509, 13, 1084, 374, 15503, 1483, 369, 35101, 6559, 3589, 518, 279, 1459, 315, 6278, 11, 3156, 448, 279, 5435, 468, 1093, 49407, 11, 438, 817, 35270, 16, 28703, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0166, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0615, -0.0036, -