{"id": "449", "question": "how do i file a lien on a semi", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages. The passages provided do not contain information on how to file a lien on a semi. Passage 1 discusses the possibility of a creditor placing a lien on a home that has been transferred to a spouse, while passage 2 explains the general process for placing a lien on business property but does not mention semis specifically. Passage 3 describes the documentation and distribution of copies of a lien entry form, but does not provide instructions on how to file a lien. Therefore, without additional information, it is impossible to provide an answer to the question.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to file a lien on a semi, one copy of the lien entry form and one copy of the lien fee receipt along with the four-part lien release form will be returned to the lien holder. Additionally, one copy of the lien entry form and one copy of the lien fee receipt will be sent to OTC in the agent's semi-monthly report. One copy will be attached to the titling documentation, and one copy will be filed at the MLA’s office.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to file a lien on a semi, one copy of the lien entry form and one copy of the lien fee receipt along with the four-part lien release form will be returned to the lien holder. Additionally, one copy of the lien entry form and one copy of the lien fee receipt will be sent to OTC in the agent's semi-monthly report. One copy will be attached to the titling documentation, and one copy will be filed at the MLA’s office.", "time_sec": 17.67, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1034, 264, 54420, 389, 264, 18267, 11, 825, 2975, 315, 279, 54420, 4343, 1352, 323, 825, 2975, 315, 279, 54420, 11060, 22567, 3156, 448, 279, 3040, 28037, 54420, 4879, 1352, 686, 387, 5927, 311, 279, 54420, 11839, 13, 22406, 11, 825, 2975, 315, 279, 54420, 4343, 1352, 323, 825, 2975, 315, 279, 54420, 11060, 22567, 686, 387, 3208, 311, 506, 7749, 304, 279, 8315, 594, 18267, 22289, 398, 1895, 13, 3776, 2975, 686, 387, 12392, 311, 279, 8142, 2718, 9705, 11, 323, 825, 2975, 686, 387, 12729, 518, 279, 79231, 748, 5163, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0019, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0005, -0.7175, -0.0025, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.2047, -0.0019, -0.014, -0.0592, -0.5926, -0.2138, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.0003, -0.0017, -0.0, -0.3148, -0.1567, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.6971, -0.0, -0.1805, -0.0003, -0.0025, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, -0.5543, -0.0003, -0.1883, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0001, -0.062, -0.216, -0.3101, -0.0002, -0.0732, -0.0007, -0.0291, -0.0056, -0.0002, -0.0221, -0.0, -0.0122, -0.4968, -0.0015, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0502, -0.0001, -0.0095, -0.0031, -0.0487, -0.0, -0.0061, -0.0, -0.0489, -0.2014, -0.0004, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.4545, -1.3392, -0.0084, -0.4939, -0.1005, -0.3876, -0.0003, -0.0003, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.9262, -0.0055, -0.4951, -0.1004, -0.0069, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.4744, 0.0, -0.0561, -0.413], "cumulative_logprob": -10.7674, "norm_logp": -0.1066, "input_len": 565, "output_tokens": 101, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.14, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "461", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits. It is known to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve blood circulation. It also aids in pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation, which subsequently improves flexibility and increases range of motion. Additionally, cupping massage has mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.", "time_sec": 21.161, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 25, 220, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 220, 17, 13, 58123, 