{"id": "575", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action as mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents by putting steel wool inside before sealing them, as steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the holes to re-enter. This adds an extra element of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Additionally, eliminate any sources of food or shelter, as rats and mice will consume discarded food and fit through tiny openings to access your home.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action as mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents by putting steel wool inside before sealing them, as steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the holes to re-enter. This adds an extra element of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Additionally, eliminate any sources of food or shelter, as rats and mice will consume discarded food and fit through tiny openings to access your home.", "time_sec": 18.987, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 438, 23627, 646, 1602, 6157, 1896, 705, 21682, 304, 697, 2114, 323, 1191, 66710, 13, 52525,