{"id": "50", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it cleans better around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it cleans better around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.", "time_sec": 16.606, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 10476, 311, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 10780, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 553, 10441, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 279, 41265, 1555, 311, 21725, 17239,