{"id": "62", "question": "set default browser to windows", "gt": "Method 1 of 2 in passage 2 provides the steps to set the default web browser in Windows 7.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps: Step 1: Open the Settings app by clicking the Start menu and selecting the Settings icon, or use the Windows + I keyboard shortcut. Step 2: Click on the \"System\" option in the left pane. Step 3: In the right pane, click on \"Default apps.\" Step 4: Scroll down to the \"Web browser\" section. Step 5: Click on the current default browser entry (such as Edge) and select the desired browser (e.g., Google Chrome or Mozilla Firefox) from the list of available apps to set it as the default.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps: Step 1: Open the Settings app by clicking the Start menu and selecting the Settings icon, or use the Windows + I keyboard shortcut. Step 2: Click on the \"System\" option in the left pane. Step 3: In the right pane, click on \"Default apps.\" Step 4: Scroll down to the \"Web browser\" section. Step 5: Click on the current default browser entry (such as Edge) and select the desired browser (e.g., Google Chrome or Mozilla Firefox) from the list of available apps to set it as the default.", "time_sec": 23.303, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 738, 279, 1638, 6929, 304, 5515, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 25, 14822, 220, 16, 25, 5264, 279, 11296, 906, 553, 18458, 279, 5145, 5022, 323, 26301, 279, 11296, 4603, 11, 476, 990, 279, 5515, 488, 358, 13625, 37115, 13, 14822, 220, 17, 25, 9189, 389, 279, 330, 2320, 1, 2999, 304, 279, 2115, 37322, 13, 14822, 220, 18, 25, 758, 279, 1290, 37322, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 3675, 10500, 1189, 14822, 220, 19, 25, 22392, 1495, 311, 279, 330, 5981, 6929, 1, 3772,