{"id": "310", "question": "avg cost to install a second floor in a house", "gt": "Hiring a remodeling contractor to build a second floor addition can cost between $100-$300 a square foot for a typical addition, but the cost can go as high as $400-$500 per square foot depending on the complexity, quality of materials and local labor rates. Building a second floor can cost at least 20 percent more than building the same square footage at ground level.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100 to $300 per square foot for a typical addition, such as 2-3 bedrooms and a bath plus a flight of stairs. In some cases, the cost can increase to $400-$500 per square foot depending on the complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates. Building a second floor typically costs at least 20 percent more than constructing the same square footage at ground level.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100 to $300 per square foot for a typical addition, such as 2-3 bedrooms and a bath plus a flight of stairs. In some cases, the cost can increase to $400-$500 per square foot depending on the complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates. Building a second floor typically costs at least 20 percent more than constructing the same square footage at ground level.", "time_sec": 18.824, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 5461, 2783, 311, 4582, 264, 2086, 6422, 304, 264, 3753, 21283, 504, 400, 16, 15, 15, 311, 400, 18, 15, 15, 817, 9334, 4478, 369, 264, 14260, 5256, 11, 1741, 438, 220, 17, 12, 18, 27589, 323, 264, 8885, 5519, 264, 10971, 315, 31149, 13, 758, 1045, 5048, 11, 279, 2783, 646, 5263, 311, 400, 19, 15, 15, 21389, 20, 15, 15, 817, 9334, 4478, 11649, 389, 279, 23094, 11, 4271,