{"id": "400", "question": "temperature bucharest", "gt": "Based on passage 3, the average temperature in Bucharest, Romania during July and August is around 23 °C (73 °F). Temperatures can also reach 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F) in mid-summer.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy with temperatures often dipping below 0 °C (32 °F), sometimes dropping as low as minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer, particularly July and August, the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F), with mid-summer temperatures often reaching 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F).", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, Bucharest has a humid continental climate. Winters can get windy with temperatures often dipping below 0 °C (32 °F), sometimes dropping as low as minus 20 °C (4 °F). In summer, particularly July and August, the average temperature is around 23 °C (73 °F), with mid-summer temperatures often reaching 35 °C (95 °F) to 40 °C (104 °F).", "time_sec": 18.342, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 33278, 15432, 702, 264, 65938, 57536, 9977, 13, 467, 49940, 646, 633, 92921, 448, 19879, 3545, 85821, 3685, 220, 15, 36286, 34, 320, 18, 17, 36286, 37, 701, 7025, 25100, 438, 3347, 438, 27283, 220, 17, 15, 36286, 34, 320, 19, 36286, 37, 568, 758, 7324, 11, 7945, 5768, 323, 6156, 11, 279, 5461, 9315, 374, 2163, 220, 17, 18, 36286, 34, 320, 22, 18, 36286, 37, 701, 448, 5099, 12, 62566, 19879, 3545, 18739, 220, 18, 20, 36286, 34, 320, 24, 20, 36286, 37, 8, 311, 220, 19, 15, 36286, 34, 320, 16, 15, 19, 36286, 37, 568, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0004, -0.0024, -0.0, -0.112, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.2327, -0.1857, -0.0001, -0.2248, -0.1672, -0.0089, -0.556, -0.0, -0.0128, -0.2658, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3103, -0.0, -0.2104, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0