{"id": "462", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits including eliminating toxins from the body, improved circulation, pain relief, and mental benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.", "time_sec": 20.933, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 25, 220, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 220, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 13, 220, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 11, 892,