{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combinations specified for the Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles. For example, the Ball Juggle skill move (while standing) is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. The passages confirm that the same controls apply across Xbox One and Xbox 360, and that video tutorials are available to demonstrate each skill move visually.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combinations specified for the Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles. For example, the Ball Juggle skill move (while standing) is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. The passages confirm that the same controls apply across Xbox One and Xbox 360, and that video tutorials are available to demonstrate each skill move visually.", "time_sec": 15.519, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 653, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 990, 279, 3137, 27459, 5189, 369, 279, 20577, 220, 18, 21, 15, 609, 20577, 3776, 50093, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 12836, 619, 49328, 9947, 3271, 320, 3472, 11259, 8, 374, 15695, 553, 9963, 34469, 323, 52628, 27974, 13, 576, 46769, 7683, 429, 279, 1852, 11574, 3796, 3941, 20577, 3776, 323, 20577, 220, 18, 21, 15, 11, 323, 429, 2766, 43812, 525, 2500, 311, 19869, 1817, 9947, 3271, 42295, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, 