{"id": "638", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, and potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapenos can help defend heart health and provide cardiovascular benefits.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños offer several health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which contributes to their heat and provides various health advantages. Jalapeños have pain-killing properties, serve as a spicy weight loss alternative, and act as a natural nasal decongestant. They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they support cardiovascular health by defending heart health and improving overall cardiovascular benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños offer several health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which contributes to their heat and provides various health advantages. Jalapeños have pain-killing properties, serve as a spicy weight loss alternative, and act as a natural nasal decongestant. They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they support cardiovascular health by defending heart health and improving overall cardiovascular benefits.", "time_sec": 18.274, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 2027, 18219, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 13, 2379, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 42972, 311, 862, 8628, 323, 5707, 5257, 2820, 22146, 13, 71895, 2027, 18219, 614, 6646, 12646, 9400, 5888, 11, 8683, 438, 264, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 11, 323, 1160, 438, 264, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969,