{"id": "46", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps: Step 1: Lay your quilt on a flat surface. Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Step 3: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, maintaining the bias fold. Step 5: Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps: Step 1: Lay your quilt on a flat surface. Step 2: Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias. Step 3: Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias. Step 4: Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, maintaining the bias fold. Step 5: Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "time_sec": 22.12, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 25, 14822, 220, 16, 25, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 13, 14822, 220, 17, 25, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 14822, 220, 18, 25, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 3259, 2704, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 14822, 220, 19, 25, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 20337, 279, 15470, 11555, 13, 14822, 220, 20, 25, 60473, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 