{"id": "51", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it cleans better around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it cleans better around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.", "time_sec": 16.708, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 10476, 311, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 10780, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 553, 10441, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 279, 41265, 1555, 311, 21725, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 2588, 311, 4057, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 13, 1084, 646, 6245, 323, 49977, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 13, 22406, 11, 432, 3419