{"id": "73", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you:\n\n1. Physical contact: Avoid physical contact that could be misinterpreted as fondling or sexual activity (Passage 1).\n2. Eye contact: If your coworker is consistently staring at you, it may be a sign that they are interested in you (Passage 2).\n3. Smiling: If your coworker smiles at you excessively, even when there is no apparent reason to do so, it may be a sign of flirtation (Passage 2).\n4. Seeking contact: If your coworker consistently finds reasons to be near you or seek you out discreetly, it may indicate that they have feelings for you (Passage 3).\n\nHowever, it is essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean that your coworker is interested in you romantically. It's important to pay attention to the context of their behavior and communicate openly to avoid misunderstandings.\n\nIf you are unsure about your coworker's intentions, it may be best to avoid physical contact and observe their behavior over time before making any conclusions. Additionally, it's crucial to respect your coworker's boundaries and maintain a professional work environment.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can tell if your male coworker is flirting with you if he always seems to be staring at you when you see him, as this is a sign that he may like you. Another indication is if he finds any reason to touch you, since this behavior is less likely if he does not have romantic interest. Additionally, if he constantly seeks you out and is frequently near your desk, it suggests he has affection or admiration for you. Pay attention to whether he smiles at you even when there is no good reason, as this can also be a sign of flirting.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can tell if your male coworker is flirting with you if he always seems to be staring at you when you see him, as this is a sign that he may like you. Another indication is if he finds any reason to touch you, since this behavior is less likely if he does not have romantic interest. Additionally, if he constantly seeks you out and is frequently near your desk, it suggests he has affection or admiration for you. Pay attention to whether he smiles at you even when there is no good reason, as this can also be a sign of flirting.", "time_sec": 21.118, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 421, 566, 2677, 4977, 311, 387, 36774, 518, 498, 979, 498, 1490, 1435, 11, 438, 419, 374, 264, 1841, 429, 566, 1231, 1075, 498, 13, 13293, 27039, 374, 421, 566, 13719, 894, 2874, 311, 5796, 498, 11, 2474, 419, 7709, 374, 2686, 4363, 421, 566, 1558, 537, 614, 23467, 2734, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 566, 14971, 25654, 498, 700, 323, 374, 13814, 3143, 697, 18010, 11, 432, 13230, 566, 702, 36705, 476, 65839, 369, 498, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 3425, 566, 42532, 518, 498, 1496, 979, 1052, 374, 902, 1661, 2874, 11, 438, 419, 646, 1083, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 87242, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0088, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.9025, -0.0033, -0.0043, -0.0074, -0.0111, -0.0024, -0.006, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.7966, -0.0097, -1.1305, -0.0555, -0.0, -0.0338, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1399, -0.003, -0.0005, -0.007, -0.513, -0.594, -0.0392, -0.8655, -0.0981, -0.1156, -0.7858, -0.0011, -0.7398, -0.7049, -0.0, -0.0019, -1.4647, -0.5618, -0.0013, -0.0542, -0.0039, -0.3994, -0.1697, -0.0267, -0.0001, -0.005, -0.0005, -0.0521, -0.5947, -0.2533, -0.0687, -0.938, -1.2509, -0.0265, -0.0171, -0.0745, -0.5952, -0.0, -0.0855, -0.2629, -0.0286, -0.0092, -0.524, -0.0, -0.2009, -0.0965, -0.7347, -0.3625, -0.2102, -0.0, -0.7369, -0.4732, -0.9272, -0.3372, -0.0791, -0.0027, -0.2366, 