{"id": "572", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's how to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Hold LT + tap RB.\n\nNote that this combination works for Xbox 360 and Xbox One controllers. If you're playing on PC with a controller, the buttons may be different. Additionally, there are tutorial videos available online that show what each skill move looks like, which can be helpful in mastering these moves.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combinations specified for the Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles. For example, the Ball Juggle skill move (while standing) is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. The passages confirm that the same controls apply across Xbox One and Xbox 360, and that video tutorials are available to demonstrate each skill move visually.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combinations specified for the Xbox 360 & Xbox One consoles. For example, the Ball Juggle skill move (while standing) is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. The passages confirm that the same controls apply across Xbox One and Xbox 360, and that video tutorials are available to demonstrate each skill move visually.", "time_sec": 15.646, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 653, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 990, 279, 3137, 27459, 5189, 369, 279, 20577, 220, 18, 21, 15, 609, 20577, 3776, 50093, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 12836, 619, 49328, 9947, 3271, 320, 3472, 11259, 8, 374, 15695, 553, 9963, 34469, 323, 52628, 27974, 13, 576, 46769, 7683, 429, 279, 1852, 11574, 3796, 3941, 20577, 3776, 323, 20577, 220, 18, 21, 15, 11, 323, 429, 2766, 