{"id": "52", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, reducing the risk of gingivitis, cleaning better around the teeth and gums, and eliminating tough-to-remove germs and plaque from the gum line.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it cleans better around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it cleans better around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.", "time_sec": 16.919, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 10476, 311, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 10780, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 553, 10441, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 279, 41265, 1555, 311, 21725, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 2588, 311, 4057, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 13, 1084, 646, 6245, 323, 49977, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 13, 22406, 11, 432, 34194, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 553, 17592, 3607, 18730, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0002, 