{"id": "74", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some signs that a male coworker may be flirting with you:\n\n* He finds reasons to be near you and seek you out discreetly (Passage 3)\n* He is always staring at you and catches your eye (Passage 2)\n* He touches you unnecessarily or finds excuses to have physical contact with you (Passage 2)\n* He smiles at you excessively or without apparent reason (Passage 2)\n* He seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him (Passage 1)\n\nIf you observe these behaviors from a male coworker, it may be a sign that he is interested in you and flirting with you. However, it's essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean the person likes you romantically, and it's possible they just have a friendly interest in you. To confirm their intentions, consider observing their behavior over time, and if you feel comfortable, try initiating a conversation or asking them out.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can tell if your male coworker is flirting with you if he always seems to be staring at you when you see him, as this is a sign that he may like you. Another indication is if he finds any reason to touch you, since this behavior is less likely if he does not have romantic interest. Additionally, if he constantly seeks you out and is frequently near your desk, it suggests he has affection or admiration for you. Pay attention to whether he smiles at you even when there is no good reason, as this can also be a sign of flirting.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can tell if your male coworker is flirting with you if he always seems to be staring at you when you see him, as this is a sign that he may like you. Another indication is if he finds any reason to touch you, since this behavior is less likely if he does not have romantic interest. Additionally, if he constantly seeks you out and is frequently near your desk, it suggests he has affection or admiration for you. Pay attention to whether he smiles at you even when there is no good reason, as this can also be a sign of flirting.", "time_sec": 21.862, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 421, 566, 2677, 4977, 311, 387, 36774, 518, 498, 979, 498, 1490, 1435, 11, 438, 419, 374, 264, 1841, 429, 566, 1231, 1075, 498, 13, 13293, 27039, 374, 421, 566, 13719, 894, 2874, 311, 5796, 498, 11, 2474, 419, 7709, 374, 2686, 4363, 421, 566, 1558, 537, 614, 23467, 2734, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 566, 14971, 25654, 498, 700, 323, 374, 13814, 3143, 697, 18010, 11, 432, 13230, 566, 702, 36705, 476, 65839, 369, 498, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 3425, 566, 42532, 518, 498, 1496, 979, 1052, 374, 902, 1661, 2874, 11, 438, 419, 646, 1083, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 87242, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0088, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.9025, -0.0033, -0.0043, -0.0074, -0.0111, -0.0024, -0.006, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0, -0.7966, -0.0097, -1.1305, -0.0555, -0.0, -0.0338, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1399, -0.003, -0.0005, -0.007, -0.513, -0.594, -0.0392, -0.8655, -0.0981, -0.1156, -0.7858, -0.0011, -0.7398, -0.7049, -0.0, -0.0019, -1.4647, -0.5618, -0.0013, -0.0542, -0.0039, -0.3994, -0.1697, -0.0267, -0.0001, -0.005, -0.0005, -0.0521, -0.5947, -0.2533, -0.0687, -0.938, -1.2509, -0.0265, -0.0171, -0.0745, -0.5952, -0.0, -0.0855, -0.2629, -0.0286, -0.0092, -0.524, -0.0, -0.2009, -0.0965, -0.7347, -0.3625, -0.2102, -0.0, -0.7369, -0.4732, -0.9272, -0.3372, -0.0791, -0.0027, -0.2366, -0.6342, -1.0033, -0.2289, -0.4636, -0.4388, -0.0704, -0.0001, -0.0035, -0.0, -0.021, -1.2288, -0.0903, -0.1053, -0.1503, -0.0216, -0.31, -0.0051, -0.0, -1.0826, -0.0268, -0.0044, -0.1995, -0.0001, -0.2497, -0.0019, -0.7854, -0.0923, -0.414, -0.61,