{"id": "464", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. 4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.", "time_sec": 21.641, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 25, 220, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 