{"id": "481", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you have used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The company does not guarantee your security when using these apps and may send you a warning message before locking your account. If you have been warned multiple times and continue using third-party apps, your account may remain locked.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts, and if you receive four warnings, your account will be locked. Some users have been locked out after receiving warnings about third-party apps, and others have found their accounts locked without prior notice. Snapchat considers third-party apps a security risk, and using them can lead to account lockouts. Additionally, a recent incident involving the leak of 200,000 private Snapchat photos through a third-party app prompted Snapchat to take stricter actions against such usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts, and if you receive four warnings, your account will be locked. Some users have been locked out after receiving warnings about third-party apps, and others have found their accounts locked without prior notice. Snapchat considers third-party apps a security risk, and using them can lead to account lockouts. Additionally, a recent incident involving the leak of 200,000 private Snapchat photos through a third-party app prompted Snapchat to take stricter actions against such usage.", "time_sec": 21.936, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 