{"id": "488", "question": "how to plan a trip to germany", "gt": "To plan a trip to Germany, it is important to plan ahead and be aware of the rules and regulations regarding travel with pets. It is also recommended to research the best ways to save money during your trip, such as looking into discounted flights, cheap hotels and hostels, and affordable dining options. Additionally, learning about German life and culture can enhance your overall trip experience.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, start by checking visa requirements, determining the best time and places to visit, and learning about what to see in Germany. Consider budget travel tips such as finding bargain flights, cheap hotels or hostels, affordable restaurants, and using public transportation. If traveling with a pet, research air travel rules, vaccinations, pet-friendly accommodations, and pet policies on German trains. Additionally, familiarize yourself with German culture to enhance your travel experience.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, start by checking visa requirements, determining the best time and places to visit, and learning about what to see in Germany. Consider budget travel tips such as finding bargain flights, cheap hotels or hostels, affordable restaurants, and using public transportation. If traveling with a pet, research air travel rules, vaccinations, pet-friendly accommodations, and pet policies on German trains. Additionally, familiarize yourself with German culture to enhance your travel experience.", "time_sec": 17.624, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 3119, 264, 8411, 311, 9856, 11, 1191, 553, 13295, 26655, 8502, 11, 25597, 279, 1850, 882, 323, 7482, 311, 3947, 11, 323, 6832, 911, 1128, 311, 1490, 304, 9856, 13, 21144, 8039, 5821, 10414, 1741, 438, 92