{"id": "602", "question": "which is better exercise cycling or aerobic", "gt": "Based on the given passages, both exercise cycling and aerobic exercise are beneficial for overall fitness.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, cycling is a type of aerobic exercise that offers specific benefits. It is particularly suitable for individuals with arthritic or orthopedic issues who may find walking painful. The indoor stationary bike provides the lowest impact workout compared to equipment like treadmills and rowing machines because it supports most of the user's weight. While aerobic exercise like running is generally beneficial, cycling can be a better option for those with joint problems due to its low-impact nature.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, cycling is a type of aerobic exercise that offers specific benefits. It is particularly suitable for individuals with arthritic or orthopedic issues who may find walking painful. The indoor stationary bike provides the lowest impact workout compared to equipment like treadmills and rowing machines because it supports most of the user's weight. While aerobic exercise like running is generally beneficial, cycling can be a better option for those with joint problems due to its low-impact nature.", "time_sec": 17.184, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 32062, 374, 264, 943, 315, 90390, 10158, 429, 6081, 3151, 7567, 13, 1084, 374, 7945, 14452, 369, 7775, 448, 796, 339, 49208, 476, 29199, 16367, 292, 4714, 879, 1231, 1477, 11435, 25118, 13, 576, 29519, 52635, 12963, 5707, 279, 15457, 5421, 25242, 7707, 311, 7096, 1075, 47714, 76, 3305, 323, 2802, 287, 12645, 1576, 432, 11554, 1429, 315, 279, 1196, 594, 4680, 13, 5976, 90390, 10158, 1075, 4303, 374, 8789, 23699, 11, 32062, 646, 387, 264, 2664, 2999, 369, 1846, 448, 10284, 5322, 4152, 311, 1181, 3347, 12, 57300, 6993, 13,