{"id": "640", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños offer several health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which contributes to their heat and provides various health advantages. Jalapeños have pain-killing properties, serve as a spicy weight loss alternative, and act as a natural nasal decongestant. They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they support cardiovascular health by defending heart health and improving overall cardiovascular benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, jalapeños offer several health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which contributes to their heat and provides various health advantages. Jalapeños have pain-killing properties, serve as a spicy weight loss alternative, and act as a natural nasal decongestant. They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer. Jalapeños are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, they support cardiovascular health by defending heart health and improving overall cardiovascular benefits.", "time_sec": 18.777, "record_process": true, "toke