{"id": "679", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, clove tea offers several benefits including soothing the senses, relieving stress, aiding digestion by stimulating blood flow, saliva, and gastric secretions, and relieving abdominal pain due to its analgesic qualities. It can also help with muscle, joint, or ligament pain when used as a compress on unbroken skin, with warm tea being effective for arthritis and cold tea for swelling. However, the passages do not mention any side effects of drinking clove tea.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_model_qwen3_omni", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, clove tea offers several benefits including soothing the senses, relieving stress, aiding digestion by stimulating blood flow, saliva, and gastric secretions, and relieving abdominal pain due to its analgesic qualities. It can also help with muscle, joint, or ligament pain when used as a compress on unbroken skin, with warm tea being effective for arthritis and cold tea for swelling. However, the passages do not mention any side effects of drinking clove tea.", "time_sec": 17.778, "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5292, 586, 15243, 6081, 3807, 7567, 2670, 64364, 279, 37107, 11, 58544, 4405, 8464